Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:16.663 --> 00:00:20.415
Today we learn: Feelings. Let's go!

5
00:00:21.613 --> 00:00:25.130
Happy. Say it with me. Happy!

6
00:00:28.629 --> 00:00:32.796
Sad. Say it with me. Sad!

7
00:00:36.309 --> 00:00:39.893
Angry. Say it with me. Angry!

8
00:00:43.386 --> 00:00:46.803
Tired. Say it with me. Tired!

9
00:00:50.284 --> 00:00:54.284
Excited. Say it with me. Excited!

10
00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:01.633
Scared. Say it with me. Scared!

11
00:01:05.133 --> 00:01:08.533
Calm. Say it with me. Calm!

12
00:01:12.023 --> 00:01:16.473
Surprised. Say it with me. Surprised!

13
