Mood. Say it with me. Mood!

14
00:01:26.949 --> 00:01:30.483
Share. Say it with me. Share!

15
00:01:34.015 --> 00:01:44.029
Grammar time! I feel + adjective. Listen. I feel happy. I feel a little tired.

16
00:01:44.079 --> 00:01:50.341
Your turn. Say it with me. I feel happy. I feel a little tired.

17
00:01:55.155 --> 00:02:02.098
I feel happy and excited today. Sometimes I feel tired or a little scared, but I try to stay calm.

18
00:02:02.148 --> 00:02:03.653
I like this story!

19
00:02:04.631 --> 00:02:10.051
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:10.101 --> 00:02:11.251
Angry!

21
00:02:12.309 --> 00:02:17.646
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:17.696 --> 00:02:18.846
Calm!

23
00:02:19.640 --> 00:02:26.924
Think and answer. How do you feel today?

24
00:02:26.974 --> 00:02:28.145
Great answer!

25
00:02:29.144 --> 00:02:33.539
Great work today! See you next time. Goodbye!

26
